-- The message each missing-token diagnostic must render. Shared by
-- `test_render`, which checks the rendering.
--
-- Which (code, construct) pairs exist is the type's business
-- (`tables/expected_token.brp` lists exactly the pairs the parser reports);
-- this list pins the wording of those with text of their own and of some that
-- read as the code's general text.
